nt_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible: Godot master branch, V4.6 on Windows 11 and MacOS\n- Not reproducible: V4.5.1 (did not exist)\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.beta (321b8c944) - macOS Tahoe (26.4.1) - Multi-window, 1 monitor - Metal (Mobile) - integrated Apple M1 (Apple7) - Apple M1 (8 threads) - 8.00 GiB memory - CoreAudio (44100 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nGodot crashes when \"credits roll\" (Easter egg) is executed via the **Project Manager.**\nDouble-click on the name (Donors -> Platinum Members) to run the \"credits roll\".\n\n<img width=\"1151\" height=\"465\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b2b95ab3-b66d-43d0-a062-ff2e6b5d31b5\" />\n\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/321b8c944fa32ee94eef44a56925105d7091be03/editor/gui/editor_about.cpp#L120-L130\n\n\n--------------------------\n\n\n<details><summary>Crash / Screenshots </summary>\n<img width=\"598\" height=\"183\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/bf456d1e-9105-4574-b6f4-7c53ca1505dc\" />\n\n\n<img width=\"837\" height=\"478\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/674fb584-dadf-44e0-ab60-f6e1e9897a33\" />\n\n</details>\n\nThe comment here reads: `Don't allow the Easter egg in the Project Manager.` \nPerhaps this check no longer works.\n\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/321b8c944fa32ee94eef44a56925105d7091be03/editor/gui/editor_about.cpp#L160-L166\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAs shown in the screenshot above, it must be executed via the Project Manager. (It works in the editor.)\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n---","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://g